---
import { Timer, Palette, Wrench, Smile, Sparkles } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="features" class="features-8">
  <div class="glow-decor"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header text-center">
      <span class="badge">
        <Sparkles class="icon-sparkle" />
        Fakta Lapangan
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ini bukan janji kosong. Ini faktanya:</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-header">
          <div class="icon-box timer-bg">
            <Timer class="icon" />
          </div>
          <h3>⏳ Yang biasa 3 jam — selesai dalam 10 menit.</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Copy prompt. Paste di Canva Code. Selesai. Sesimpel itu. Hemat waktu berharga kamu untuk keluarga atau istirahat.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-header">
          <div class="icon-box palette-bg">
            <Palette class="icon" />
          </div>
          <h3>🎨 Bisa dipakai untuk mata pelajaran APA PUN.</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Matematika, Bahasa Indonesia, IPA, IPS, Bahasa Inggris — semua bisa. Cukup ganti topik materi di dalam promptnya.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-header">
          <div class="icon-box wrench-bg">
            <Wrench class="icon" />
          </div>
          <h3>🔧 Hasil nggak sesuai? Tinggal ubah promptnya.</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Tidak ada yang namanya stuck atau macet. Cukup sesuaikan arahan prompt atau klik refresh, AI akan membuatkan yang baru.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-header">
          <div class="icon-box smile-bg">
            <Smile class="icon" />
          </div>
          <h3>😊 Siswa tanya: "Pak/Bu, besok belajar apa lagi?"</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Materi yang interaktif bikin siswa antusias dan betah belajar. Tidak ada lagi cerita siswa bosan atau mengantuk di kelas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-8 {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: #0f172a;
    color: #f8fafc;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .glow-decor {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .header {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
    color: #fbbf24;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
  }

  .icon-sparkle {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .feature-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .icon-box .icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .timer-bg { background: #3b82f6; }
  .palette-bg { background: #ec4899; }
  .wrench-bg { background: #f59e0b; }
  .smile-bg { background: #10b981; }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .feature-header {
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
